[aten/src/ATen/native/cpu/Activation.cpp] Computing `exp` and `log1p` twice and also the division can be pretty expensive. I have an alternative expression you can use. You'll have to convert it to the `Vectorized` form but it works for scalars:

```cpp
// softplus(x, beta)
scalar_t y = x * beta;
scalar_t z = log1p(exp(-abs(y))) / beta;
return (y > 0 ? x : zero) + z;
```

This also applies to all the other places in this PR.

